# P36 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): press String label button, open and close the first picker, and append 12 to the text field without losing its text.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p36-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-015431.png (1640x1606, 2x, halved; origin=frame, 28 pt native title bar). All three AppKit clicks landed on other rows on GTK's taller layout: the button click hit the Tagged picker, the picker click the Labelled text, the field click the Tagged selection text (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2).
# String label button (93,379), first picker (59,157), text field (410,425). x 410 is past the end of the text, so GTK puts the caret at the end on its own; Cmd-Right is kept from the AppKit file and is harmless either way.
# After this file the field must read SwiftCrossUI TextField12.
# macOS 上 GtkBackend 的 P36:三個點擊都重新量測;之後欄位必須是 SwiftCrossUI TextField12。
